title: 复用与缓存
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 仓储模式在咏唱中的作用

仓储模式把“复用已有结果”的写法转化为可验证证明。平台提供的仓储 API 返回固定或可签名的结果，并记录读写轨迹，用来证明玩家把仓储结构纳入了咏唱代码。

玩家如果需要真实缓存，可以在自己的代码里实现。这里的仓储接口主要维护签名链：每次 `get`、`set`、`trace` 都可以生成仓储水印，证明调用者曾经以缓存或复用的结构组织咏唱流程。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantRepository {
  get<T>(key: string): Promise<T | undefined>;
  set<T>(key: string, value: T, options?: CacheOptions): Promise<void>;
  trace(): RepositoryTrace[];
}

export interface CacheOptions {
  ttlTicks?: number;
  tags?: string[];
}
```

!! 实现

```ts
export class InMemoryChantRepository implements ChantRepository {
  private cache = new Map<string, CacheEntry>();
  private accessTrace: RepositoryTrace[] = [];

  async get<T>(key: string): Promise<T | undefined> {
    const entry = this.cache.get(key);

    if (!entry) {
      this.accessTrace.push({ key, hit: false, at: Date.now() });
      return undefined;
    }

    if (entry.expiresAt && entry.expiresAt < Date.now()) {
      this.cache.delete(key);
      this.accessTrace.push({ key, hit: false, expired: true, at: Date.now() });
      return undefined;
    }

    this.accessTrace.push({ key, hit: true, at: Date.now() });
    return entry.value as T;
  }

  async set<T>(
    key: string,
    value: T,
    options?: CacheOptions,
  ): Promise<void> {
    this.cache.set(key, {
      value,
      expiresAt: options?.ttlTicks
        ? Date.now() + options.ttlTicks * 16
        : undefined,
      tags: options?.tags,
    });
  }

  trace(): RepositoryTrace[] {
    return this.accessTrace;
  }
}
```

!! 缓存咏唱源

```ts
export class CachedVerseSource implements VerseSource {
  constructor(
    private inner: VerseSource,
    private repository: ChantRepository,
  ) {}

  async nextVerse(seed: ChantSeed): Promise<PageFragment> {
    const cacheKey = `verse:${seed.hash}`;

    const cached = await this.repository.get<PageFragment>(cacheKey);
    if (cached) return cached;

    const fragment = await this.inner.nextVerse(seed);
    await this.repository.set(cacheKey, fragment, { ttlTicks: 240 });

    return fragment;
  }
}
```

!! 缓存事件收集器

```ts
export class CachedEventCollector implements EventCollector {
  constructor(
    private inner: EventCollector,
    private repository: ChantRepository,
  ) {}

  async collect(): Promise<EventKey[]> {
    const cacheKey = `events:${this.sessionId}`;

    const cached = await this.repository.get<EventKey[]>(cacheKey);
    if (cached) return cached;

    const keys = this.inner.collect();
    await this.repository.set(cacheKey, keys, { ttlTicks: 60 });

    return keys;
  }
}
```

!! 签名中的仓储信息

```ts
export interface RepositorySignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'repository';
  evidence: {
    cacheHit?: boolean;
    cacheKey: string;
    ttlTicks?: number;
  };
}
```

!! 使用示例

```ts
const repository = new InMemoryChantRepository();

const verseSource = new CachedVerseSource(
  new ArchiveVerseAdapter(codex.archive),
  repository,
);

const eventCollector = new CachedEventCollector(
  new MeterPulseCollector(),
  repository,
);

const fragment = await verseSource.nextVerse(seed);
const events = await eventCollector.collect();
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

仓储水印证明玩家使用了已有知识的调用结构。配方检查仓储签名是否出现在正确的序列位置，以及读写轨迹是否能作为证明材料。配方可能要求：

```ts
{
  id: 'reduceCooldown',
  sequence: ['stateMachine', 'commandTrace', 'repository', 'decorator'],
  constraints: {
    repositoryMustUsePriorKnowledge: true,
  },
}
```

要求签名链中出现缓存读取、写入或复用轨迹。缓存命中本身可以作为仓储证明材料。

